# Git Commit Message Rules

- When generating Git commit messages (especially when clicking the Sparkle / AI Generate button in the Source Control panel), you MUST ALWAYS write the commit message in Simplified Chinese (简体中文).
- DO NOT use English for the commit description.
- 必须遵循 Conventional Commits 格式规范：`<type>(<scope>): <中文简述>`
  - feat: 新增功能
  - fix: 修复 Bug / 缺陷
  - refactor: 代码重构
  - docs: 文档变更
  - chore: 构建工具、依赖变更
  - style: 格式调整（不影响逻辑）
  - test: 测试用例变动
